# Raw Garmin bulk export — large, and full of account and health records that have
# no business in a repo. tools/*_digest.py turn these into the small derived files
# that the build actually reads, and those are what get committed.
garmin/ex/
garmin/health/
garmin/hist/
garmin/*.zip
garmin/*.fit

# build scratch
verify-mobile.png
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# never
.env
*token*
*.pem
